Now we start.

Step 1: create_candidate shift_candidate_alpha
Precondition: not candidate_created shift_candidate_alpha, not dispatched shift_candidate_alpha. True.
Effect: candidate_created shift_candidate_alpha.

Step 2: allocate_vehicle_unit shift_candidate_alpha vehicle_unit_gamma (choose gamma)
Precondition: candidate_created shift_candidate_alpha, not vehicle_allocated shift_candidate_alpha, vehicle_available vehicle_unit_gamma. True.
Effect: vehicle_allocated shift_candidate_alpha, candidate_vehicle_linked shift_candidate_alpha vehicle_unit_gamma, not vehicle_available vehicle_unit_gamma.

Step 3: attach_task_profile shift_candidate_alpha route_task_profile_alpha
Precondition: candidate_created shift_candidate_alpha, vehicle_allocated shift_candidate_alpha, route_task_profile_available route_task_profile_alpha. True.
Effect: candidate_task_profile_linked shift_candidate_alpha route_task_profile_alpha, not route_task_profile_available route_task_profile_alpha.

Step 4: confirm_candidate_preparedness shift_candidate_alpha route_task_profile_alpha
Precondition: candidate_created shift_candidate_alpha, vehicle_allocated shift_candidate_alpha, candidate_task_profile_linked shift_candidate_alpha route_task_profile_alpha, not candidate_prepared shift_candidate_alpha. True.
Effect: candidate_prepared shift_candidate_alpha.

Step 5: assign_operator_resource shift_candidate_alpha driver_operator_alpha
Precondition: candidate_prepared shift_candidate_alpha, operator_available driver_operator_alpha. True.
Effect: candidate_operator_linked shift_candidate_alpha driver_operator_alpha, not operator_available driver_operator_alpha.

Step 6: apply_operational_constraint shift_candidate_alpha operational_constraint_alpha route_task_profile_alpha
Precondition: candidate_prepared shift_candidate_alpha, candidate_task_profile_linked shift_candidate_alpha route_task_profile_alpha, operational_constraint_available operational_constraint_alpha, candidate_operational_constraint_linked shift_candidate_alpha operational_constraint_alpha, not constraint_applied shift_candidate_alpha. True.
Effect: constraint_applied shift_candidate_alpha, not operational_constraint_available operational_constraint_alpha.

Step 7: confirm_operator_alignment shift_candidate_alpha driver_operator_alpha
Precondition: constraint_applied shift_candidate_alpha, candidate_operator_linked shift_candidate_alpha driver_operator_alpha, not operator_alignment_confirmed shift_candidate_alpha. True.
Effect: operator_alignment_confirmed shift_candidate_alpha.

Step 8: assign_compliance_certificate shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha
Precondition: candidate_prepared shift_candidate_alpha, compliance_certificate_available compliance_certificate_alpha. True (we still have it available).
Effect: candidate_compliance_certificate_linked shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha, not compliance_certificate_available compliance_certificate_alpha.

Step 9: verify_compliance_certificate shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha
Precondition: operator_alignment_confirmed shift_candidate_alpha, candidate_compliance_certificate_linked shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha, not compliance_validation_complete shift_candidate_alpha. True.
Effect: compliance_validation_complete shift_candidate_alpha.

Step 10: release_compliance_certificate shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha
Precondition: candidate_compliance_certificate_linked shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha.
Effect: compliance_certificate_available compliance_certificate_alpha, not candidate_compliance_certificate_linked shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha.

Now compliance_certificate_available restored.

Step 11: finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation shift_candidate_alpha
Precondition: compliance_validation_complete shift_candidate_alpha, not candidate_finalized shift_candidate_alpha. True.
Effect: candidate_finalized shift_candidate_alpha, dispatch_ready shift_candidate_alpha.

Now shift_candidate_alpha is dispatch_ready.

